Fréchet [distribution], z_frechet [SimTalk]
The Fréchet distribution is also called the Gumbel type II distribution or the inverse Weibull distribution.
Remarks
Use the Fréchet distribution and the Gumbel distribution if you want to find out the maximum of several
random numbers.
