Gumbel [distribution], z_gumbel [SimTalk]
The Gumbel distribution is also called the log-Weibull, the Gumbel type I distribution or the extreme value
distribution.
Remarks
Use the Gumbel distribution to model the distribution of the maximum (or the minimum) of a number of
samples of various distributions.
Syntax
z_gumbel([Stream:integer,]Mu:time,Theta:real[,LowerBound:real,UpperBound:rea
l]) → real
